{"id": "Deeg0pSAJ3u", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "A third of this QR code is gone. It still scans. 🤯\n\nQR codes carry backup: extra codewords built with Reed–Solomon error correction, the same math that kept scratched CDs playing. At level H, about 30% of a code can be rebuilt. That's why brands can stick a logo in the middle.\n\nEvery code in this reel is real. We tore it, then decoded it.\n\nSend this to the friend who gives up on a peeled-off UPI QR 😅\n\n#qrcode #techexplained #howtechworks #computerscience #upi", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792033776, "like_count": 5, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18140054524575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.248, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMbWE0cjXeiRXGobZbIyCC8J0dkekq4hMGF3TO0pBwJS6V_vZI0yqLHstvmi7E1Tnh9XRBvTHHWv6CmA4Ynoz2pX-SzwvF0DGJBVCA.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=AdoRHRpp9xMPllGS6kLA2e4THZzCGigqVCifef3NP9xL1oZBln8dP4lrJFMRyU4qGJUIo-4UaSllawx5ts4DH2Qz&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=JCUnFupRbEAQ7kNvwFuzmZ-&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=aTpWDp1cGg6nBZ1_Npq2BA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSuFw9Hdzm3j_sMGjseGAH6TbIR4lGPC39_yW0PghT2Ug&oe=6AF40198", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 63.248, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) Ap